{"route":"/docs/5.2/components/progress/","version":"5.2","renderedVersion":"5.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Progress","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for using Bootstrap custom progress bars featuring support for stacked bars, animated backgrounds, and text labels."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Progress components are built with two HTML elements, some CSS to set the width, and a few attributes. We don’t use <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/progress\">the HTML5 <code>&lt;progress&gt;</code> element</a>, ensuring you can stack progress bars, animate them, and place text labels over them."},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"We use the <code>.progress</code> as a wrapper to indicate the max value of the progress bar."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"We use the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> to indicate the progress so far."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> requires an inline style, utility class, or custom CSS to set their width."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> also requires some <code>role</code> and <code>aria</code> attributes to make it accessible, including an accessible name (using <code>aria-label</code>, <code>aria-labelledby</code>, or similar)."}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Put that all together, and you have the following examples."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-1","type":"demo","key":"cca288c4d6b1fe53c013","height":300},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap provides a handful of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/utilities/sizing/\">utilities for setting width</a>. Depending on your needs, these may help with quickly configuring progress."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-2","type":"demo","key":"2b35e079b6e86838088d","height":147},{"id":"how-it-works--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"labels","type":"heading","en":"Labels","level":2},{"id":"labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add labels to your progress bars by placing text within the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"labels--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2b9b55754e6f5dd86f52","height":147},{"id":"labels--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">25%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"height","type":"heading","en":"Height","level":2},{"id":"height--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"We only set a <code>height</code> value on the <code>.progress</code>, so if you change that value the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> will automatically resize accordingly."},{"id":"height--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fbab4d541a2c29954400","height":174},{"id":"height--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 1px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 20px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"backgrounds","type":"heading","en":"Backgrounds","level":2},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use background utility classes to change the appearance of individual progress bars."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b5cb9785706f45741b4d","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"backgrounds--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies","type":"heading","en":"Conveying meaning to assistive technologies","level":5},{"id":"conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies – such as screen readers. Ensure that information denoted by the color is either obvious from the content itself (e.g. the visible text), or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."}]},{"id":"multiple-bars","type":"heading","en":"Multiple bars","level":2},{"id":"multiple-bars--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Include multiple progress bars in a progress component if you need."},{"id":"multiple-bars--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d14cc3430cd8f6c2d31c","height":147},{"id":"multiple-bars--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" style=\"width: 15%\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" style=\"width: 30%\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" style=\"width: 20%\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"striped","type":"heading","en":"Striped","level":2},{"id":"striped--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.progress-bar-striped</code> to any <code>.progress-bar</code> to apply a stripe via CSS gradient over the progress bar’s background color."},{"id":"striped--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a27090857e46c2fd5ac3","height":300},{"id":"striped--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Default striped example\" style=\"width: 10%\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success striped example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info striped example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning striped example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger striped example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"animated-stripes","type":"heading","en":"Animated stripes","level":2},{"id":"animated-stripes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The striped gradient can also be animated. Add <code>.progress-bar-animated</code> to <code>.progress-bar</code> to animate the stripes right to left via CSS3 animations."},{"id":"animated-stripes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d41c16181ceedc631b76","height":147},{"id":"animated-stripes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Animated striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Added in v5.2.0</small>"},{"id":"variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"As part of Bootstrap’s evolving CSS variables approach, progress bars now use local CSS variables on <code>.progress</code> for enhanced real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are set via Sass, so Sass customization is still supported, too."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"  --#{$prefix}progress-height: #{$progress-height};\n  @include rfs($progress-font-size, --#{$prefix}progress-font-size);\n  --#{$prefix}progress-bg: #{$progress-bg};\n  --#{$prefix}progress-border-radius: #{$progress-border-radius};\n  --#{$prefix}progress-box-shadow: #{$progress-box-shadow};\n  --#{$prefix}progress-bar-color: #{$progress-bar-color};\n  --#{$prefix}progress-bar-bg: #{$progress-bar-bg};\n  --#{$prefix}progress-bar-transition: #{$progress-bar-transition};","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$progress-height:                   1rem;\n$progress-font-size:                $font-size-base * .75;\n$progress-bg:                       $gray-200;\n$progress-border-radius:            $border-radius;\n$progress-box-shadow:               $box-shadow-inset;\n$progress-bar-color:                $white;\n$progress-bar-bg:                   $primary;\n$progress-bar-animation-timing:     1s linear infinite;\n$progress-bar-transition:           width .6s ease;","language":"scss"},{"id":"keyframes","type":"heading","en":"Keyframes","level":3},{"id":"keyframes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Used for creating the CSS animations for <code>.progress-bar-animated</code>. Included in <code>scss/_progress-bar.scss</code>."},{"id":"keyframes--code-1","type":"code","value":"@if $enable-transitions {\n  @keyframes progress-bar-stripes {\n    0% { background-position-x: $progress-height; }\n  }\n}","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"cca288c4d6b1fe53c013","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2b35e079b6e86838088d","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2b9b55754e6f5dd86f52","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">25%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fbab4d541a2c29954400","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 1px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 20px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b5cb9785706f45741b4d","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d14cc3430cd8f6c2d31c","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" style=\"width: 15%\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" style=\"width: 30%\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" style=\"width: 20%\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a27090857e46c2fd5ac3","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Default striped example\" style=\"width: 10%\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success striped example\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info striped example\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning striped example\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger striped example\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d41c16181ceedc631b76","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Animated striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":